        "text_VBhKCP": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>\"AltaRasa is a fashion-led platform shaping a contemporary expression of South Asian design - culturally grounded, globally fluent, and quietly confident.\"</p><p>AltaRasa is a fashion-led platform shaping a contemporary expression of South Asian design - culturally grounded, globally fluent, and quietly confident.</p><p>We are led by silhouette, shape, design intelligence, and the way fashion lives and breathes across bodies, places, and lives.</p><p>This is fashion approached with discovery and discernment. </p><p>South Asian design holds extraordinary depth: in material knowledge, proportion, craftsmanship, and cultural nuance. Yet too often, it has been framed through nostalgia, excess, or occasion alone.</p><p>AltaRasa exists to shift this lens.</p><p>Here, heritage is treated as living intelligence.<br/>Craft is understood as a value system, not an aesthetic.<br/>Fashion is approached as a personal archive built slowly, worn intuitively, and returned to over time.</p><p>We curate with clarity and intention, creating space for designers and garments to be discovered, respected, and worn beyond moment or trend.</p>",
