                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>AltaRasa’s journey is one of discipline.</p><p>From its earliest conception, the platform has focused on editing rather than expanding, choosing clarity over noise, and depth over volume.</p><p>Each collection, collaboration, and story builds toward a larger vision: to celebrate South Asian design, and allow garments to speak through how they are worn, lived in, and remembered.</p>",
