                    "text_zaX6EJ": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>South Asian design has always held depth - in material knowledge, proportion, craftsmanship, and cultural nuance. Yet it has often been framed through nostalgia, occasion, or excess.</p><p>AltaRasa shifts this lens.</p><p>Here, heritage is treated as living intelligence.<br/>Craft is understood as a value system.<br/><br/>Fashion is approached as a personal archive collected slowly, worn intuitively, and returned to over time.</p><p>We believe South Asian design belongs confidently within the global fashion conversation, not as an exception or category, but as an equal contributor.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
